  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safe Schools Initiative AU StC Africa endorsement and implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safe Schools Inititive to Africa. Embedded in African Union, promoting endorserment and encourage implementation. The project has a special focus on the right to education for children who live in conflict, including a special focus on gender (including rights for girls and women and boys and men) and excluded.</narrative>
  </description>
